            0.152,
            0.856,
            0.212
          ],
          "content": "What procedure would you use to square a given triangle? Here, the task is to construct a square whose area is equal to the area of some given triangle. Think carefully. How would you proceed?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
